<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Puducherry - Tax Receipt</title>

    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:ital,wght@0,100;0,300;0,400;0,500;0,700;0,900;1,100;1,400;1,500&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="<%= data.host %>/css/style.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="<%= data.host %>/css/page.css" />
    <style>
      /* Light inline adjustments so the page looks good in browser */
      body { font-family: "Roboto", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color:#111; }
      .main { padding: 24px; }
      .content__top { text-align:center; margin-bottom: 8px; }
      .content__heading { margin:0; font-size:18px; }
      .content__title { margin:4px 0; font-size:14px; }
      .content__desc { margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:12px; }
      table { width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 6px; }
      table tr.r1 td { padding:6px 8px; vertical-align: top; font-size:13px; }
      .r1-1 { width:20%; font-weight: 600; }
      .r1-2 { width:30%; }
      .content__money { margin-top:12px; border:1px solid #ddd; padding:6px; font-size:13px; }
      .content__money-r1, .content__money-r2 { display:flex; align-items:center; }
      .content__money-r1 .m1 { flex:2; font-weight:700; }
      .content__money-r1 .m2, .content__money-r1 .m3, .content__money-r1 .m4 { flex:1; text-align:center; }
      .content__amount { margin-top:12px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:13px; }
      .content__last { margin-top:16px; font-size:12px; color:#222; line-height:1.35; }
      .pdf-footer { margin-top:18px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; }
      .qr-block img { width:110px; height:110px; }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="main">
      <div class="content">
        <div class="content__top">
          <h3 class="content__heading">GOVERNMENT OF PUDUCHERRY</h3>
          <p class="content__title">Department of Transport</p>
          <p class="content__desc">Checkpost Tax e-Receipt</p>
        </div>

        <table>
          <tr class="r1">
            <td class="r1-1">Registration No.</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <b><%= data.vehicleNo || '' %></b></td>

            <td class="r1-1">Receipt No.</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.receiptNo || '' %></td>
          </tr>

          <tr class="r1">
            <td class="r1-1">Payment Date</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.paymentDate || data.receiptDate || '' %></td>

            <td class="r1-1">Owner Name</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.ownerName || '' %></td>
          </tr>

          <tr class="r1">
            <td class="r1-1">Chassis No.</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.chassisNo || '' %></td>

            <td class="r1-1">Tax Mode</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.taxMode || '' %></td>
          </tr>

          <tr class="r1">
            <td class="r1-1">Vehicle Type</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.vehiclePermitType || '' %></td>

            <td class="r1-1">Vehicle Class</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.vehicleClass || '' %></td>
          </tr>

          <tr class="r1">
            <td class="r1-1">Mobile No.</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.mobileNo || '' %></td>

            <td class="r1-1">District</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.borderBarrier || data.districtName || '' %></td>
          </tr>

          <tr class="r1">
            <td class="r1-1">Checkpost Name</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.checkpostName || data.checkPostName || '' %></td>

            <% if (data.vehiclePermitType === 'GOODS VEHICLE') { %>
              <td class="r1-1">Gross Weight</td>
              <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.grossVehicleWeight || '' %> KG</td>
            <% } else { %>
              <td class="r1-1">Seating Cap (Ex. Driver)</td>
              <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.seatingCapacityExcludingDriver || '' %></td>
            <% } %>
          </tr>

          <tr class="r1">
            <td class="r1-1">Sleeper Cap.</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.sleeperCap || data.sleeperCapacityExcludingDriver || '' %></td>

            <td class="r1-1">Bank Ref. No.</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.upBankRefNo || data.bankRefNo || '' %></td>
          </tr>

          <tr class="r1">
            <td class="r1-1">Payment Mode</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.paymentMode || '' %></td>

            <td class="r1-1">Service Type</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.serviceType || '' %></td>
          </tr>

          <tr class="r1">
            <td class="r1-1">Permit Type</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%= data.permitType || '' %></td>

            <td class="r1-1">Permit From / Upto</td>
            <td class="r1-2">
              : <%= data.permitFrom ? data.permitFrom : '' %>
              <% if (data.permitUpto) { %> / <%= data.permitUpto %> <% } %>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="content__money">
          <div class="content__money-r1">
            <div class="m1"><b>Particular</b></div>
            <div class="m2"><b>Fees/Tax</b></div>
            <div class="m3"><b>Fine</b></div>
            <div class="m4"><b>Total</b></div>
          </div>

          <div class="content__money-r2">
            <div class="m1">MV Tax ( <%= data.taxFrom_up || data.taxFrom || '' %> TO <%= data.taxTo_up || data.taxTo || '' %> )</div>
            <div class="m2"><%= data.totalAmount || 0 %></div>
            <div class="m3">0</div>
            <div class="m4"><%= data.totalAmount || 0 %></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content__amount">
          <div class="content__amount-r1">
            <div class="a1">Amount in Words: <strong><%= data.totalAmountInWord || '' %></strong> ONLY</div>
          </div>

          <div class="content__amount-r2" style="text-align:right;">
            <div class="a1">Paid Upto: <%= data.taxTo_up || data.taxTo || '' %></div>
            <div class="a2">Total Paid: <%= data.totalAmount || 0 %></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pdf-footer">
          <div class="qr-block">
            <% if (data.src) { %>
              <img src="<%= data.src %>" alt="QR" />
            <% } %>
          </div>

          <div class="signature">
            <div>Authorised Signatory</div>
            <div style="margin-top:40px">________________________</div>
            <div style="font-size:11px; margin-top:6px;">For Transport Department</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content__last">
          <div class="content__last-title"><p>Condition for Acceptance of Payment of Tax</p></div>
          <div class="content__last-text">
            <p>
              1. The Tax so recovered is subject to verification of documents and loading capacity of vehicle. In case of any false information pertaining to the documents such as vehicle particulars, the tax, penalty and other charges collected shall be adjusted against tax due and balance collected from the vehicle owner/user.
            </p>
            <p>
              2. Checkpost authorities reserve the right to cancel or modify the entire tax in case where the owner of the vehicle or driver provide false information in the payment of tax. Any excess payment shall be refunded back to the vehicle owner/user on reconciliation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
